version: "1.0"
date-released: "2026-09-20"
abstract: >
  Photony Theory is a proposed physical framework developed by Fred Lane Martin
  to explore the underlying structure of space, energy, matter, electromagnetism,
  gravitation, and time. The framework includes Planck Space, elemental charge
  photons, electron-mediated transduction, electric chains, magnetic chains,
  and classical photons.
repository-code: "repository-code: "https://github.com/martinf001/Photony""
